            <ArticleTitle>A finding of myocardial uptake at a bone scintigraphy with Tc-99m HDP.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>419-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a patient admitted to our Department for a Tc-99m HDP three-phase bone scintigraphy to evaluate a hip prosthesis. Delayed images showed diffuse myocardial uptake at whole body scan. In such cases, several diseases should be considered in the differential diagnosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
